        "portalId": "938be8c4-4a61-41dd-957c-b12cc05060d9",
        "title": "Lesson 1",
        "overview": "In this lesson, we delve into the Shamāʾil al-Tirmidhī, a beautiful compilation by Imām al-Tirmidhī that describes the physical and moral characteristics of the Prophet Muhammad (ﷺ). We begin by exploring the biography of Imām al-Tirmidhī, his early life, travels in search of knowledge, and his significant teachers, including the great Imām al-Bukhārī. We also discuss his exceptional memory, contributions to the science of hadith, and the importance of studying works like the Shamāʾil to connect with the Prophet's legacy. The lesson emphasizes the virtue of knowledge gatherings and reflects on the significance of preserving and embodying the noble traits of the Prophet (ﷺ) in our daily lives.\n\nThe Shamāʾil class is streamed live every Thursday night from 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM EST. To access the live stream, join the Shamāʾil Telegram group, where all the links are shared:\nhttps://t.me/+hl9Sy6ROgW83YzAx\n\nFor more content visit our website :\nhttps://talweehacademy.com/\n\nFollow us on :\nTelegram : https://t.me/TalweehAcademy\nTwitter : https://x.com/Talweeh_Academy\nInstagram : https://www.instagram.com/talweeh.academy/",
        "topic": "",
