        "portalId": "951647c0-6b8c-49b9-9392-6707b55b40d1",
        "title": "Lesson 4",
        "overview": "This lesson covers the first narration from the chapter \"باب ما جاء في خَلق رسول الله ﷺ,\" focusing on the physical attributes of the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ, as described by Anas ibn Malik. It details the Prophet’s medium height, reddish-white complexion, naturally wavy hair, and few white hairs, reflecting his vitality and the impact of revelations. The narration also touches on his prophethood beginning at 40, his 13 years in Makkah, and 10 years in Madīnah. The lesson explores the transmission of ḥadīth, particularly the roles of Qutaybah ibn Saʿīd and Mālik ibn Anas, highlighting their contributions to preserving ḥadīth knowledge. Additionally, Rabīʿah al-Raʾy, a key teacher of Imam Mālik, is noted for his influential presence in Madīnah. Anas ibn Malik’s service to the Prophet ﷺ is also highlighted, showcasing the Prophet’s patience and kindness. The Prophet ﷺ often applied oil to his hair, contributing to his youthful appearance. Finally, the lesson discusses how true visions of the Prophet ﷺ in dreams align with his description in Hadith, offering spiritual insights.\n\nShamāʾil Class - Live Stream | Every Thursday Night 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM EST\n\nJoin us for our live Shamāʾil class every Thursday night from 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM EST! Delve into the beautiful descriptions and qualities of the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ and enrich your knowledge of his character.\n\n🔗 To access the live stream, join our Shamāʾil Telegram group where the links will be shared:\nhttps://t.me/+hl9Sy6ROgW83YzAx\n\nFor more beneficial content, visit our official website:\nhttps://talweehacademy.com/\n\n🔹 Stay connected with us on social media:\nTelegram: https://t.me/TalweehAcademy\nTwitter: https://x.com/Talweeh_Academy\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/talweeh.academy/\n\nDon't forget to like, share, and subscribe for more inspiring content!\nSee you in class! 💫\n\n#Shamail #Shamāʾil #ProphetMuhammad ﷺ #Sunnah #IslamicKnowledge #IslamicClasses #TalweehAcademy #Hadith #LiveStream #IslamicEducation #ProphetDescription #Faith #LearningIslam #MuslimCommunity",
