        "portalId": "50e8880d-cb0a-4970-bb0e-4d6222d2f7c7",
        "title": "Lesson 8",
        "overview": "In this lesson, we explore the physical appearance and habits of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), focusing particularly on his blessed hair. Narrations describe his hair ranging from reaching the earlobes to his shoulders, with scholars offering various explanations for the differences in length based on when the hair was observed. While the Prophet’s (ﷺ) personal habits were not obligatory for the Sahabah to follow, they emulated him out of love and reverence.\n\nAdditionally, we discuss the Prophet's (ﷺ) red garment and the nuances of the term \"red\" in hadith, noting that the vivid red we recognize today did not exist in his time. The red garment is likely a Yemeni hullah with earthy tones, and scholarly views on wearing red clothing differ, with some deeming it makrūh and others finding it permissible. We also explore the unparalleled beauty of the Prophet (ﷺ), described by the Companions as unmatched in radiance. Finally, going on a tangent, we address the inclusion of narrations from weak narrators, like ʿUbayy ibn al-ʿAbbās, in Ṣaḥīḥ al-Bukhārī, explaining Imām Bukhārī's careful selection of authentic hadith.\n\nShamāʾil Class - Live Stream | Every Thursday Night 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM EST\n\nJoin us for our live Shamāʾil class every Thursday night from 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM EST! Delve into the beautiful descriptions and qualities of the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ and enrich your knowledge of his character.\n\n🔗 To access the live stream, join our Shamāʾil Telegram group where the links will be shared:\nhttps://t.me/+hl9Sy6ROgW83YzAx\n\nFor more beneficial content, visit our official website:\nhttps://talweehacademy.com/\n\n🔹 Stay connected with us on social media:\nTelegram: https://t.me/TalweehAcademy\nTwitter: https://x.com/Talweeh_Academy\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/talweeh.academy/\n\nDon't forget to like, share, and subscribe for more inspiring content!\nSee you in class! 💫\n\n#Shamail #Shamāʾil #ProphetMuhammad ﷺ #Sunnah #IslamicKnowledge #IslamicClasses #TalweehAcademy #Hadith #LiveStream #IslamicEducation #ProphetDescription #Faith #LearningIslam #MuslimCommunity",
