        "overview": "In this lesson, we delve into the final portions of a lengthy Hadīth which shows the exemplary leadership and humility of the Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him). Despite his unparalleled status as the final prophet, he led by example, embodying humility and compassion. He would turn his entire body to face those addressing him, demonstrating respect and attentiveness. His interactions were marked by genuine care; for instance, he would stop and listen attentively to anyone, regardless of their social standing. His generosity was limitless. Even in his personal habits, he exemplified humility, choosing simple seating postures and modest attire. His leadership was characterized by gentleness. This helped foster a community built on mutual respect and devotion. This lesson highlights how his actions and demeanor provide timeless guidance on effective and compassionate leadership.\n\nShamāʾil Class - Live Stream | Every Thursday Night 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM EST\n\nJoin us for our live Shamāʾil class every Thursday night from 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM EST! Delve into the beautiful descriptions and qualities of the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ and enrich your knowledge of his character.\n\n🔗 To access the live stream, join our Shamāʾil Telegram group where the links will be shared:\nhttps://t.me/+hl9Sy6ROgW83YzAx\n\nFor more beneficial content, visit our official website:\nhttps://talweehacademy.com/\n\n🔹 Stay connected with us on social media:\nTelegram: https://t.me/TalweehAcademy\nTwitter: https://x.com/Talweeh_Academy\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/talweeh.academy 📸\n\nDon't forget to like, share, and subscribe for more inspiring content!\nSee you in class! 💫\n\n#Shamail #Shamāʾil #ProphetMuhammad ﷺ #Sunnah #IslamicKnowledge #IslamicClasses #TalweehAcademy #Hadith #LiveStream #IslamicEducation #ProphetDescription #Faith #LearningIslam #MuslimCommunity",
