        "overview": "In this lesson, we cover the biography of al-Imam al-Qudūrī. His life, teachers, books, and students are covered in detail, as well as the Hanafi School of Iraq. The leading scholars of this school, such as al-Jassas and al-Karkhi are discussed, along with Abu Ja'far al-Tahawi, and their contributions to the school.",
        "topic": ""
