        "portalId": "b8633422-9b6f-4e7b-86f0-ea2e14d8d339",
        "title": "Lesson 11 | Riwāyah and the Meanings of Sunnah and Ḥadīth in the Science of Ḥadīth",
        "overview": "This lesson forms part of a detailed study of ʿUlūm al-Ḥadīth (the sciences of ḥadīth), focusing specifically on the concept of riwāyah (رِوَايَة) and its relationship to the transmission of the Sunnah. The lesson aims to clarify technical terminology, resolve apparent contradictions among scholars, and equip students with a principled framework for understanding disagreements in the Islamic sciences. It highlights the essence of riwāyah, it types, conditions, rulings etc.",
        "topic": ""
