        "overview": "This lesson continuous the exploration of the historical development of the title al-Ḥāfiẓ (الحَافِظ) within the discipline of ʿIlm al-Ḥadīth (عِلْمُ الحَدِيثِ), the science dedicated to the preservation, transmission, and critical analysis of the sayings and actions of the Prophet Muḥammad ﷺ.\nThe discussion centers on how classical scholars understood the concept of memorization (ḥifẓ), how standards evolved over time, and how later scholars reassessed earlier definitions in light of historical change. The lesson also addresses exaggerated reports, corrects common misconceptions, and highlights the spiritual dimension of knowledge preservation.",
