        "overview": "In this lesson, we continue the discussion of الصَّحِيحُ (al-Ṣaḥīḥ) by presenting the definition given by of al-Khaṭṭābī, followed by a number of objections made against it. The discussion also highlights the methodological divergence between muḥaddithūn (ḥadīth scholars) and fuqahāʾ (jurists), revealing how different scholarly paradigms can lead to varying conclusions regarding the authenticity of reports.",
